    "text": "fayettevilleflyer.com\nwebsite\nFayetteville\nFuego Tortilla Grill to open Fayetteville location\nBy Dustin Bartholomew,\n10 hours agoA Tex-Mex restaurant specializing in handmade tortillas, tacos, breakfast tacos, and other items is planning to open a new location in Fayetteville this fall. The restaurant, called Fuego Tortilla Grill, is in the works at 2190 Martin Luther King Jr. Blvd., in the space formerly home to C-Mac’s Southern Kitchen.",
